<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:70%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S4.T6.fig2.8" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:129%;">Table 5</span>: </span><span id="S4.T6.fig2.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:129%;">Effect of Transport Formulations in TNE.<span id="S4.T6.fig2.9.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Evaluated on </span>SID-Set<span id="S4.T6.fig2.9.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> with </span>SIDA-7B<span id="S4.T6.fig2.9.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> (10% retention). Explicitly modeling unmatchable tokens via dummy nodes is crucial for capturing generative artifacts.</span></span></figcaption>
